{"alignment_method": "asr_cue_grouping", "alignment_quality": null, "asr_source_id": "SRC_C2_GETTR_14EF99726AC6", "boundary_method": "natural_asr_v1:topic_shift_self_discipline", "content_sha256": "01b383eeb297e2831773941c3f9ba682e3ce59d482163076be18748199540368", "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:27:55Z", "curated_source_id": null, "end_frame": null, "end_sec": 108.98, "entities_json": null, "fps_at_index": null, "headline": "讲述者一边开会和录视频一边健身，强调救人前要先照顾好自己。", "id": "LIVE_20220227_003_SEG_000001", "keywords_json": null, "live_id": "LIVE_20220227_003", "playback_verified": 0, "playback_verified_at": null, "review_status": "machine", "segment_index": 1, "segment_type": "speech", "source_verified": 1, "start_frame": null, "start_sec": 86.98, "text_asr": "我把生意屏蔽 然后健身 开会 录视频 救人很重要 先把自己救了 不管任何理由 都要 健身呐 希望兄弟姐妹们能看昨天的紧急大直播", "text_curated": null, "text_search": "我把生意屏蔽 然后健身 开会 录视频 救人很重要 先把自己救了 不管任何理由 都要 健身呐 希望兄弟姐妹们能看昨天的紧急大直播", "text_summary": "讲述者一边开会和录视频一边健身，强调救人前要先照顾好自己。；讲述者称无论有什么理由都要健身。；讲述者请听众回看前一天的紧急直播。", "time_source_id": "SRC_C2_GETTR_14EF99726AC6", "topic_primary": "健康", "topic_secondary": "媒体与舆论", "updated_at": "2026-10-25T00:27:55Z"}
{"alignment_method": "asr_cue_grouping", "alignment_quality": null, "asr_source_id": "SRC_C2_GETTR_14EF99726AC6", "boundary_method": "natural_asr_v1:topic_shift_ukraine_rescue", "content_sha256": "7fefdcd6cb4e3140f9858b66c5e86d5aea0200a1df140257c9823751f13f3113", "created_at": "2026-10-25T00:27:55Z", "curated_source_id": null, "end_frame": null, "end_sec": 126.98, "entities_json": null, "fps_at_index": null, "headline": "讲述者把乌克兰救援称为当前目标。", "id": "LIVE_20220227_003_SEG_000002", "keywords_json": null, "live_id": "LIVE_20220227_003", "playback_verified": 0, "playback_verified_at": null, "review_status": "machine", "segment_index": 2, "segment_type": "speech", "source_verified": 1, "start_frame": null, "start_sec": 108.98, "text_asr": "关于乌克兰救人 救人是我们的现在皈依目标 但是别着急 跟我没有缘分的 没有姻缘的 结不成姻缘 别着急 啊 疯了 太多人想救了", "text_curated": null, "text_search": "关于乌克兰救人 救人是我们的现在皈依目标 但是别着急 跟我没有缘分的 没有姻缘的 结不成姻缘 别着急 啊 疯了 太多人想救了", "text_summary": "讲述者把乌克兰救援称为当前目标。；讲述者呼吁不要着急，并称想参与救援的人太多。", "time_source_id": "SRC_C2_GETTR_14EF99726AC6", "topic_primary": "国际关系", "topic_secondary": null, "updated_at": "2026-10-25T00:27:55Z"}
